# Ledger Shredder, played for real. Turn 7 Bot1 has four lands: a Pyrite Spellbomb is the first spell, the Shredder
# itself the second -- cast before it is on the battlefield, so it triggers nothing -- and a second Spellbomb the
# third. Spells cast before the Shredder entered still count, so no later spell this turn is "the second": it ends
# a 1/3 with no counter.

